# Simple Calculator Test
# This tests basic UniControl functionality.
# Note: Calculator's operator buttons are titled "Add"/"Equals" in the
# accessibility tree, not "+"/"=" (use `dumptree` to discover titles).

mode strict
log Starting Calculator test
launch Calculator

log Clicking number 5
waitfor 5 role: AXButton timeout: 10
click

log Clicking Add button
waitfor Add role: AXButton
click

log Clicking number 3
waitfor 3 role: AXButton
click

log Clicking Equals button
waitfor Equals role: AXButton
click

assert exists Equals role: AXButton
log Test complete! Result should be 8 in Calculator
